{
  "uid": "pc-business",
  "title": "PowerContext · 库存与用量明细",
  "description": "从主监控页进入的业务明细。填写业务空间可看一个业务空间；留空则汇总所有可访问业务空间。库存是当前快照，模型用量按 UTC 周期，不受图表时间范围影响。手动刷新；缺少数据或权限不足显示未知，不显示为零。",
  "schemaVersion": 40,
  "version": 8,
  "tags": [
    "powercontext"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "refresh": "",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "scope_id",
        "label": "业务空间",
        "type": "textbox",
        "query": "",
        "current": {
          "text": "",
          "value": ""
        },
        "options": [
          {
            "text": "",
            "value": "",
            "selected": true
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "name": "period",
        "label": "用量周期（UTC）",
        "type": "custom",
        "query": "today,7d,30d",
        "current": {
          "text": "30d",
          "value": "30d"
        },
        "options": [
          {
            "text": "today",
            "value": "today",
            "selected": false
          },
          {
            "text": "7d",
            "value": "7d",
            "selected": false
          },
          {
            "text": "30d",
            "value": "30d",
            "selected": true
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 200,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 4
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "**这里查看库存与模型用量。** “业务空间（Scope）”是业务隔离空间；输入（Source）是形成记忆的原始记录；记忆（Memory）是已保存的长期记忆；产物（Artifact）是可检索产物；Token 是模型处理的计量单位。业务空间留空时汇总所有可访问业务空间。库存是当前快照；模型用量按 UTC 周期，不随图表时间范围变化。"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "记忆数量 · 当前库存",
      "type": "stat",
      "datasource": {
        "type": "yesoreyeram-infinity-datasource",
        "uid": "pc-stats"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "type": "json",
          "source": "url",
          "format": "table",
          "parser": "backend",
          "url": "http://stats:8080/stats?scope_id=${scope_id:percentencode}&period=${period}",
          "url_options": {
            "method": "GET"
          },
          "root_selector": "inventory.memory.entries",
          "columns": [
            {
              "selector": "total",
              "text": "总计",
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "selector": "active",
              "text": "有效",
